.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
._*
**/._*
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
**/.venv/
.tmp/
.tmp-docx-render/
.env
*.log
~$*
**/~$*
~WRL*.tmp
**/~WRL*.tmp

# Student submission archives — local only (see Subjects/STORAGE.md)
Subjects/S3-CMP/notes/Python & AI/Lesson 5/_archive/

# Large teaching media — keep locally, not in git
*.mp4
*.apk
*.aia
*.zip

# Local tool output (transcripts, drafts) — do not commit
output/

# Student report — ephemeral working data on T: drive only (not in git)
Administrative/CHW/student-report/_local/
Administrative/CHW/student-report/export/*.xlsx

# Student submissions / PII — never commit
**/_student_submissions/
**/_student_submissions/**

# marking/ runtime data — never commit (downloads, extracted aias, results)
**/marking/attachments/
**/marking/aias/
**/marking/marksheets/
**/marking/marksheets/**
**/marking/screenshots/
**/marking/.cache/
**/marking/results.csv
**/marking/manual_marking/
**/marking/records/
**/marking/student_data/
**/marking/task_info/
# Local API / OAuth secrets (commit only *.example.* templates — see configs/README.md)
configs/*.json
!configs/*.example.json
configs/.env
configs/.env.local
configs/client_secret*
configs/google-forms-oauth-token.json
